OL,3,GNEWSAPowerlifter who had eating
OL,4,Adisorder now wants to be strong
OL,5,
OL,6,FA powerlifter who used to suffer with
OL,7,Fbulimia says she can now lift twice the
OL,8,Fsize of her body weight, and is
OL,9,Fcurrently a record breaker for
OL,10,Fdeadlifting.
OL,12,FAmera Ross, 22, from Bristol, lifted
OL,13,F182.5kg at an ABPU powerlifting
OL,14,Fcompetition - one of the biggest
OL,15,Ffederations in the UK - setting a
OL,16,Frecord in her age and weight class.
OL,18,FThe amount she lifted is roughly
OL,19,Fequivalent to an adult male lion,
OL,20,Fdespite Ross weighing 69kg. She says
OL,21,Fpowerlifting has enabled her to
OL,22,Fovercome her eating disorder.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
