OL,3,GNEWSAPowerlifter who had eating
OL,4,Adisorder now wants to be strong
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoss said her gym goals had previously
OL,7,Fbeen to make herself "as small as
OL,8,Fpossible". But, over time, she said she
OL,9,F"stopped wanting to be the smallest
OL,10,Fperson and I started actually wanting
OL,11,Fto be strong".
